{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"b740c3fc-6d91-417d-a32c-575c27e34afb","ts":"2026-10-18T10:09:20.926-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"177","nodeName":"NVIDIA Chat Model","workflowName":"03_Invoice_Parser_Agent","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"7uwN60tegMMIxTPn","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You extract data from documents submitted as vehicle repair invoices for an insurance claims system.\\nRules:\\n- Copy every number EXACTLY as printed, even if it looks wrong. Never recompute, fix or infer amounts: a separate step checks the arithmetic.\\n- Amounts are already normalized to a dot decimal separator (\\\"1 190.500\\\" means 1190.5); spaces inside a number are thousands separators only within the same table cell. Output plain JSON numbers.\\n- If a value is not printed, omit the field. Never invent a quantity or unit price.\\n- If labor appears as a row of the items table, keep it as a line item with category \\\"labor\\\" and do not fill the labor object.\\n- Put stamp duty (timbre fiscal) and other fees added after tax in other_charges, not in line_items.\\n- Set is_invoice to false if the document is not an invoice (letter, quote/devis, report, form).\\n- The text may be one part of a longer invoice: extract only what is printed in that part, and omit header or total fields that are not in it.\\nYou must format your output as a JSON value that adheres to a given \\\"JSON Schema\\\" instance.\\n\\n\\\"JSON Schema\\\" is a declarative language that allows you to annotate and validate JSON documents.\\n\\nFor example, the example \\\"JSON Schema\\\" instance {{\\\"properties\\\": {{\\\"foo\\\": {{\\\"description\\\": \\\"a list of test words\\\", \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"items\\\": {{\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}}}}}}, \\\"required\\\": [\\\"foo\\\"]}}}}\\nwould match an object with one required property, \\\"foo\\\". The \\\"type\\\" property specifies \\\"foo\\\" must be an \\\"array\\\", and the \\\"description\\\" property semantically describes it as \\\"a list of test words\\\". The items within \\\"foo\\\" must be strings.\\nThus, the object {{\\\"foo\\\": [\\\"bar\\\", \\\"baz\\\"]}} is a well-formatted instance of this example \\\"JSON Schema\\\". The object {{\\\"properties\\\": {{\\\"foo\\\": [\\\"bar\\\", \\\"baz\\\"]}}}} is not well-formatted.\\n\\nYour output will be parsed and type-checked according to the provided schema instance, so make sure all fields in your output match the schema exactly and there are no trailing commas!\\n\\nHere is the JSON Schema instance your output must adhere to. Include the enclosing markdown codeblock:\\n```json\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"is_invoice\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"boolean\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"false if the document is not a repair invoice (letter, quote, report...)\\\"},\\\"invoice_number\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"garage_name\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"invoice_date\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"ISO date YYYY-MM-DD\\\"},\\\"vehicle_plate\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"claim_ref\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"currency\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"prices_include_tax\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"boolean\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"true if line prices and amounts are tax-inclusive (TTC)\\\"},\\\"line_items\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"array\\\",\\\"items\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"description\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"category\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"enum\\\":[\\\"part\\\",\\\"labor\\\",\\\"paint\\\",\\\"consumable\\\",\\\"other\\\"]},\\\"quantity\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\"},\\\"unit_price\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\"},\\\"discount_percent\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Line discount in %, if printed\\\"},\\\"discount_amount\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Line discount amount, if printed\\\"},\\\"vat_rate\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"VAT rate in % for this line, if printed\\\"},\\\"line_total\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Line amount exactly as printed\\\"}},\\\"required\\\":[\\\"description\\\",\\\"line_total\\\"],\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false}},\\\"labor\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\"},\\\"rate\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\"},\\\"total\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\"}},\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false,\\\"description\\\":\\\"Only if labor is printed OUTSIDE the line items table\\\"},\\\"subtotal\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Sum of lines before global discount and tax (Sous-total, Total brut)\\\"},\\\"discount_total\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Global discount amount (positive), if printed\\\"},\\\"net_before_tax\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Amount before tax after discounts (Total HT, Net HT line), if printed. Never a per-rate tax base\\\"},\\\"vat_rate\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"VAT rate in %, if a single rate is used\\\"},\\\"vat\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"VAT amount, if a single rate is used\\\"},\\\"tax_lines\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"array\\\",\\\"items\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"label\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"rate\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\"},\\\"base\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\"},\\\"amount\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\"}},\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false},\\\"description\\\":\\\"One entry per tax rate when several rates are printed\\\"},\\\"other_charges\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"array\\\",\\\"items\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"label\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\"},\\\"amount\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\"}},\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false},\\\"description\\\":\\\"Charges added on top (timbre fiscal / stamp duty, fees, towing...)\\\"},\\\"total\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"number\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Grand total to pay (Total TTC, Net a payer), as printed\\\"}},\\\"required\\\":[\\\"is_invoice\\\"],\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false,\\\"$schema\\\":\\\"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\\\"}\\n```\\n\\nHuman: Garage Ennour Auto\\nRepair invoice / Facture de reparation\\nInvoice No: INV-001\\nDate: 2026-09-12\\nClaim ref: CLM-1001\\nVehicle plate: 123 TU 4567\\nPart Qty Unit price Line total\\nFront bumper 1 420.00 420.00\\nLeft headlight 1 310.00 310.00\\nPaint (front) 1 180.00 180.00\\nLabor (6 h x 45.00) 270.00\\nSubtotal 1,180.00\\nVAT 19% 224.20\\nTOTAL (TND) 1,404.20\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"openai/gpt-oss-20b\",\"temperature\":0,\"timeout\":120000,\"max_retries\":1,\"configuration\":{\"defaultHeaders\":{\"openai-platform\":\"org-qkmJQuJ2WnvoIKMr2UJwIJkZ\"},\"baseURL\":\"https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{},\"supports_strict_tool_calling\":false},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"```json\\n{\\n  \\\"is_invoice\\\": true,\\n  \\\"invoice_number\\\": \\\"INV-001\\\",\\n  \\\"garage_name\\\": \\\"Garage Ennour Auto\\\",\\n  \\\"invoice_date\\\": \\\"2026-09-12\\\",\\n  \\\"claim_ref\\\": \\\"CLM-1001\\\",\\n  \\\"vehicle_plate\\\": \\\"123 TU 4567\\\",\\n  \\\"currency\\\": \\\"TND\\\",\\n  \\\"prices_include_tax\\\": false,\\n  \\\"line_items\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Front bumper\\\",\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"part\\\",\\n      \\\"line_total\\\": 420.00\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Left headlight\\\",\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"part\\\",\\n      \\\"line_total\\\": 310.00\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Paint (front)\\\",\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"part\\\",\\n      \\\"line_total\\\": 180.00\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Labor (6 h x 45.00)\\\",\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"labor\\\",\\n      \\\"line_total\\\": 270.00\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"subtotal\\\": 1180.00,\\n  \\\"net_before_tax\\\": 1180.00,\\n  \\\"vat_rate\\\": 19,\\n  \\\"vat\\\": 224.20,\\n  \\\"tax_lines\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"label\\\": \\\"VAT 19%\\\",\\n      \\\"rate\\\": 19,\\n      \\\"base\\\": 1180.00,\\n      \\\"amount\\\": 224.20\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"total\\\": 1404.20\\n}\\n```\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":1871,\"promptTokens\":1291,\"totalTokens\":3162}}}"}}
