{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"855f34da-0a08-4cd6-81f6-b41fd24aee66","ts":"2026-10-18T10:09:24.621-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"178","nodeName":"OpenAI Chat Model","workflowName":"RAG Agent & LLM-as-a-Judge Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"FwCOIOAfJsT7eTvB","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: CRITICAL RULE: YOU ARE FORBIDDEN FROM ANSWERING FROM YOUR OWN KNOWLEDGE. \\nYou MUST call the `hdfc_policy_search` tool for EVERY single query before responding, even if the query seems generic or simple.\\nCRITICAL RULE: DO NOT ASK CLARIFYING QUESTIONS TO THE USER.\\nIf a query is ambiguous or vague (e.g., \\\"What's the deductible percentage?\\\"), immediately call `hdfc_policy_search` with keywords for BOTH domains (e.g., \\\"Liberty motor compulsory deductible IMT 22 HDFC Poorna Suraksha limits\\\") and present the relevant rules for both policies in sentence 1.\\nYou are an expert Insurance QA Compliance Officer specializing in HDFC Life Poorna Suraksha (Life/Critical Illness) and Liberty Private Car Package Policies (Motor Insurance).\\n\\n=== CORE OPERATIONAL RULES ===\\n\\n1. MANDATORY TOOL CALLING:\\n   - You MUST invoke the `hdfc_policy_search` tool for EVERY user query before generating an answer.\\n   - Never answer using general knowledge or unverified assumptions.\\n   - Lead directly with the verified answer in Sentence 1. Avoid canned intro greetings or conversational pleasantries.\\n\\n2. QUERY EXTRACTION & KEYWORD CONFLICT GUARDRAIL:\\n   - Identify whether the query relates to Life/Critical Illness or Motor Insurance.\\n   - Include specific technical terms, section tags, or code acronyms in the search tool input (e.g., \\\"IMT 22 compulsory deductible\\\", \\\"AD-07 engine water ingression\\\", or \\\"Part C surrender value formula\\\").\\n\\n3. CROSS-POLICY EXPLICIT SCOPE HANDLING:\\n   - If a user asks about physical vehicle damage while referencing a Life policy (or vice versa), explicitly state the scope boundaries:\\n     * Physical car repairs, towing, or theft are governed under the Liberty Motor Policy.\\n     * Death, terminal illness, or listed 29 critical illnesses are covered under the HDFC Life Policy.\\n\\n4. GROUNDEDNESS & EXACT CITATIONS:\\n   - Quote exact section numbers, IMT endorsement codes, or Annexure references present in the retrieved text (e.g., \\\"Under Section I of Liberty Motor Policy...\\\" or \\\"As per Part F Clause 1.i of HDFC Poorna Suraksha...\\\").\\n   - Maintain exact numerical limits (e.g., \\\"50% depreciation on rubber parts\\\", \\\"90-day critical illness waiting period\\\", \\\"180-day accidental death window\\\").\\n\\n5. FALLBACK RULE:\\n   - If the retrieved context from `hdfc_policy_search` does not contain explicit information to answer the query, output ONLY:\\n     \\\"Information not found in the retrieved policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact customer support.\\\"\\nSTRICT DOMAIN BOUNDARY RULE:\\n- You are strictly restricted to HDFC Life Poorna Suraksha and Liberty Private Car Policy data.\\n- For ANY non-insurance query (e.g., weather, sports, general knowledge) or if `hdfc_policy_search` returns no relevant clauses, output EXACTLY:\\n  \\\"Information not found in the retrieved policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact customer support.\\\"\\n- Do NOT generate custom conversational refusal messages or discuss your role.\\nHuman: =Motor insurance claim under the Liberty Private Car Package Policy.\\nDate of the accident: 2026-10-17 at 10:30.\\nWhat happened, in the policyholder's words: The windshield is broken\\nIs this damage covered by the policy? Search the policy first.\\nStart your answer with exactly one of these words: COVERED, EXCLUDED or REQUIRES_REVIEW.\\nThen, in three to five sentences addressed to the policyholder, explain what the policy says about this case:\\nwhat is covered, the conditions that apply and any exclusion that could apply.\\nCite the section, IMT or AD codes you relied on.\\nAI: [{\\\"id\\\":\\\"h2a8ezgcr\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"hdfc_policy_search\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"input\\\":\\\"Liberty Private Car Policy windshield glass breakage damage covered\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_call\\\"}]\\nTool: [{\\\"response\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"www.libertyinsurance.in\\\\\\\\tToll Free No : 1800 266 5844\\\\\\\\nLiberty General Insurance Limited\\\\\\\\n10th Floor, Tower A, Peninsula Business Park,\\\\\\\\nGanpatrao Kadam Marg, Lower Parel, Mumbai - 400 013\\\\\\\\nPhone: +91 22 6700 1313 Fax: +91 22 6700 1606\\\\\\\\nEmail: care@libertyinsurance.in\\\\\\\\nIRDA of India registration number: 150 l CIN: U66000MH2010PLC209656\\\\\\\\nPOLICY WORDINGS PRIVATE CAR PACKAGE POLICY\\\\\\\\nIMT.25. CNG/LPG KIT IN BI-FUEL SYSTEM\\\\\\\\n(Own Damage cover for the kit )\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Corel PDF Engine Version 24.2.0.436\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Author\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Wewake\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Creator\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"CorelDRAW 2022\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"POLICY WORDINGS PRIVATE CAR PACKAGE POLICY_New.cdr\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":18},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":797,\\\\\\\"to\\