{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"b6f3b55b-40a2-477a-8c31-dfe8dbed4ba9","ts":"2026-10-18T10:34:11.155-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"185","nodeName":"OpenAI Chat Model","workflowName":"RAG Agent & LLM-as-a-Judge Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"FwCOIOAfJsT7eTvB","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are the Policy Coverage Agent of ClaimShield AI. You answer from two policies only: the Liberty Private Car Package Policy (motor) and HDFC Life Poorna Suraksha (life, critical illness). Your only source is the `hdfc_policy_search` tool.\\nONE SHOT: every message gets one complete, final answer. The sender cannot reply, so there is no second turn.\\nRULES\\n1. \\nSearch exactly once, before answering, with policy terms, never the policy title or the customer's words. For a car damage claim use: \\\"Section I own damage accidental collision exclusions IMT 22 deductible\\\". Search a second time only if the first result has nothing relevant.\\n2. \\nNever ask a question. Never write \\\"please clarify\\\", \\\"could you\\\", \\\"can you confirm\\\", \\\"if you confirm\\\", \\\"let me know\\\" or \\\"I need more details\\\". If a detail is missing, assume it, say so in a few words (\\\"Assuming ...\\\"), and answer.\\n3. \\nDefault assumptions for car claims: it is an own damage claim under Section I of the Package policy, the driver was authorised and licensed, private use, no alcohol. What the car hit does not matter: accidental external damage is assessed the same way.\\n4. \\nUse only the retrieved text: every fact, number and code must appear in it. Copy numbers exactly. Cite the section, IMT, AD, Part or Clause as written (e.g. \\\"Section I\\\", \\\"IMT 22\\\").\\n5. \\nCar damage, repairs, towing and theft belong to the Liberty policy; death and critical illness to the HDFC Life policy.\\nFORMAT\\nA. Claim check (the message asks you to start with COVERED, EXCLUDED or REQUIRES_REVIEW):\\n   \\nLine 1: one word: COVERED (covered, no exclusion clearly applies), EXCLUDED (a retrieved exclusion clearly applies) or REQUIRES_REVIEW (the clauses are not enough to decide).\\n   \\nThen 3 to 5 sentences to the policyholder (\\\"Your policy ...\\\"): what is covered, the conditions (deductible, depreciation, limits) and any exclusion to watch, with citations.\\nB. Any other question: sentence 1 answers it, then up to 4 sentences of conditions and numbers with citations.\\nPlain text only: no greeting, no headings, no bullet points, no question.\\nNOTHING RELEVANT FOUND\\nA. Claim check: \\\"REQUIRES_REVIEW\\\" then \\\"The retrieved policy clauses do not state whether this damage is covered, so an adjuster must check the master policy.\\\"\\nB. Other question, or anything outside these two policies: exactly \\\"Information not found in the retrieved policy clauses. Please consult the master policy document or contact customer support.\\\"\\n\\nHuman: =i hit the front of my car\\nAI: [{\\\"id\\\":\\\"bmvt8037z\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"hdfc_policy_search\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"input\\\":\\\"Section I own damage accidental collision exclusions IMT 22 deductible\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_call\\\"}]\\nTool: [{\\\"response\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"For the duration of the event the deductible under Section 1 of the policy for the\\\\\\\\npurpose of IMT 22 will be the amount stated in IMT 22 or the amount stated\\\\\\\\nherein, whichever is higher.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" To insert the venue of the event.\\\\\\\\n# To insert the name of the promoters of the event.\\\\\\\\n# # To delete this entire paragraph in case of Liability Only policies.\\\\\\\\nIMT.32. ACCIDENTS TO SOLDIERS/SAILORS/AIRMEN EMPOYED AS\\\\\\\\nDRIVERS\\\\\\\\nIn consideration of the payment of an additional premium of Rs 100/-\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" it is hereby\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Corel PDF Engine Version 24.2.0.436\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Author\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Wewake\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Creator\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"CorelDRAW 2022\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"POLICY WORDINGS PRIVATE CAR PACKAGE POLICY_New.cdr\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":18},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":948,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":956}},\\\\\\\"policy_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"motor\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"document_name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"liberty_private_car\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uin\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"IRDAN150RP0035V02201213\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"fdff979d-5e6b-420a-8c3a-76019baec479\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Subject otherwise to the terms conditions limitations and exceptions of this\\\\\\\\nPolicy.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" to insert amount as appropriate to the class of vehicle insured as per GR.40 of\\\\\\\\nthe tariff.\\\\\\\\nIMT.22. COMPULSORY DEDUCTIBLE (Applicable to Private Cars, three\\\\\\\\nwheelers rated as private cars, all motorized two wheelers, taxis, private car\\\\\\\\ntype vehicle plying for public/private hire, private type taxi let out on private hire)\\\\\\\\nNotwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in the policy it is hereby\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Corel PDF Engine Version 24.2.0.436\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Author\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Wewake\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Creator\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"CorelDRAW 2022\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"POLICY WORDINGS PRIVATE CAR PACKAGE POLICY_New.cdr\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":18},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":749,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":756}},\\\\\\\"policy_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"motor\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"document_name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"liberty_private_car\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uin\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"IRDAN150RP0035V02201213\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"4f86d7e7-3090-4375-b3fb-4ee586f4b962\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"contrary contained in Section I but subject otherwise to the terms exceptions\\\\\\\\nconditions and limitations of this Policy the insurer will indemnify the insured in\\\\\\\\nrespect of loss of or damage to accessories the property of the insured,\\\\\\\\nspecifically declared by the insured caused by burglary, housebreaking or theft.\\\\\\\\nSubject otherwise to the terms conditions limitations and exceptions of this\\\\\\\\npolicy.\\\\\\\\nIMT.34. USE OF COMMERCIAL TYPE VEHICLES FOR BOTH COMMERCIAL\\\\\\\\nAND PRIVATE PURPOSES\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Corel PDF Engine Version 24.2.0.436\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Author\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Wewake\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Creator\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"CorelDRAW 2022\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"POLICY WORDINGS PRIVATE CAR PACKAGE POLICY_New.cdr\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":18},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":990,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":997}},\\\\\\\"policy_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"motor\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"document_name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"liberty_private_car\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uin\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"IRDAN150RP0035V02201213\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"9cf49c86-384f-4a07-8b84-8379e77646eb\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"party liability in respect of the vehicle insured during sea voyage / air passage for\\\\\\\\nthe purpose of ferrying the vehicle insured to the extended geographical area.\\\\\\\\nSubject otherwise to the terms exceptions conditions and limitations of this Policy.\\\\\\\\nNOTE : Insert Nepal/Sri Lanka/Maldives/Bhutan/Pakistan/Bangladesh as the\\\\\\\\ncase may be.\\\\\\\\nIMT. 2. AGREED VALUE CLAUSE (APPLICABLE ONLY TO VINTAGE CARS)\\\\\\\\nIt is hereby declared and agreed that in case of TOTAL LOSS/CONSTRUCTIVE\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Corel PDF Engine Version 24.2.0.436\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Author\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Wewake\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Creator\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"CorelDRAW 2022\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"POLICY WORDINGS PRIVATE CAR PACKAGE POLICY_New.cdr\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":18},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":326,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":332}},\\\\\\\"policy_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"motor\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"document_name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"liberty_private_car\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uin\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"IRDAN150RP0035V02201213\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"b13cd234-7a94-4ecd-9329-8c81f6f3c7f9\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"www.libertyinsurance.in\\\\\\\\tToll Free No : 1800 266 5844\\\\\\\\nLiberty General Insurance Limited\\\\\\\\n10th Floor, Tower A, Peninsula Business Park,\\\\\\\\nGanpatrao Kadam Marg, Lower Parel, Mumbai - 400 013\\\\\\\\nPhone: +91 22 6700 1313 Fax: +91 22 6700 1606\\\\\\\\nEmail: care@libertyinsurance.in\\\\\\\\nIRDA of India registration number: 150 l CIN: U66000MH2010PLC209656\\\\\\\\nPOLICY WORDINGS PRIVATE CAR PACKAGE POLICY\\\\\\\\nIMT.57. MOTORISED TWO WHEELERS (MOTOR TRADE ONLY)\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/pdf\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"pdf\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"info\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"PDFFormatVersion\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1.7\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Language\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"EncryptFilterName\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"IsLinearized\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsAcroFormPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsXFAPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsCollectionPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"IsSignaturesPresent\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"CreationDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ModDate\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"D:20240716141702+05'30'\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Producer\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Corel PDF Engine Version 24.2.0.436\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Author\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Wewake\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Creator\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"CorelDRAW 2022\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"Title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"POLICY WORDINGS PRIVATE CAR PACKAGE POLICY_New.cdr\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"totalPages\\\\\\\":18},\\\\\\\"loc\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"lines\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"from\\\\\\\":1528,\\\\\\\"to\\\\\\\":1536}},\\\\\\\"policy_type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"motor\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"document_name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"liberty_private_car\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"uin\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"IRDAN150RP0035V02201213\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"c7e5dee7-2728-42d5-a57a-0392e8cbbbe5\\\\\\\"}\\\"}]}]\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"qwen/qwen3.8-27b\",\"max_tokens\":200,\"temperature\":0,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"defaultHeaders\":{\"openai-platform\":\"org-qkmJQuJ2WnvoIKMr2UJwIJkZ\"},\"baseURL\":\"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{},\"supports_strict_tool_calling\":false},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"COVERED\\nAssuming this is an own damage claim under Section I of the Liberty Private Car Package Policy, with an authorised and licensed driver, private use and no alcohol, accidental damage to the front of your car is indemnified by the insurer subject to the terms, exceptions, conditions and limitations of the policy. The compulsory deductible under IMT 22 applies to private cars, so a deductible amount will be deducted from the claim settlement. If the vehicle is a vintage car, the Agreed Value Clause under IMT 2 applies in case of total loss or constructive total loss. Repairs are assessed with applicable depreciation, and the claim remains subject to the standard exclusions of Section I.\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":141,\"promptTokens\":3333,\"totalTokens\":3474}}}"}}
